    "text": "Let <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10,6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>C</mi></math> is the center of locus of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> (which is a circle)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/012702c5-2091-4d45-a5f9-89cedd1a68b3.jpeg\" style=\"width:1.55833in;height:1.21667in\" /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is right-angled isosceles triangle<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> perimeter<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</